---
import DocsLayout from '../../../layouts/DocsLayout.astro';
import RuntimeCodeTabs from '../../../components/RuntimeCodeTabs.astro';
---

<DocsLayout
  title="Scaling Rate Limiters - hitlimit | Horizontal Scaling & Redis Cluster"
  description="Scale rate limiting from single server to distributed architecture. Redis cluster setup, horizontal scaling, multi-tier limits, store migration, and performance benchmarks."
  keywords="scale rate limiter, distributed rate limiting, redis cluster rate limit, horizontal scaling rate limit, multi-tier rate limiting, bun scaling rate limit, rate limit performance"
>
  <h1>Scaling Guide</h1>

  <p>Scale hitlimit from a single server to a distributed architecture.</p>

  <h2 id="single-instance">Single Instance</h2>

  <p>For small deployments, the memory store works well:</p>

  <RuntimeCodeTabs
    node='<span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} hitlimit, memoryStore {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">&#39;@joint-ops/hitlimit&#39;</span>\n\n<span class="kw">const</span> limiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}\n  limit: <span class="num">100</span>,\n  window: <span class="str">&#39;1m&#39;</span>,\n  store: <span class="fn">memoryStore</span>({"{"}\n    cleanupInterval: <span class="num">60000</span>\n  {"}"})\n{"}"})'
    bun='<span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} hitlimit {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">&#39;@joint-ops/hitlimit-bun&#39;</span>\n\n<span class="kw">const</span> limiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}\n  limit: <span class="num">100</span>,\n  window: <span class="str">&#39;1m&#39;</span>\n{"}"})'
  />

  <h2 id="horizontal-scaling">Horizontal Scaling with Redis</h2>

  <p>For multiple instances, use Redis to share state:</p>

  <RuntimeCodeTabs
    node='<span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} hitlimit {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">&#39;@joint-ops/hitlimit&#39;</span>\n<span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} redisStore {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">&#39;@joint-ops/hitlimit/stores/redis&#39;</span>\n\n<span class="kw">const</span> limiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}\n  limit: <span class="num">1000</span>,\n  window: <span class="str">&#39;1m&#39;</span>,\n  store: <span class="fn">redisStore</span>({"{"}\n    url: <span class="str">&#39;redis://redis-cluster:6379&#39;</span>,\n    prefix: <span class="str">&#39;api:ratelimit:&#39;</span>\n  {"}"})\n{"}"})'
    bun='<span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} hitlimit {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">&#39;@joint-ops/hitlimit-bun&#39;</span>\n<span class="kw">import</span> {"{"} redisStore {"}"} <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">&#39;@joint-ops/hitlimit-bun/stores/redis&#39;</span>\n\n<span class="kw">const</span> limiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}\n  limit: <span class="num">1000</span>,\n  window: <span class="str">&#39;1m&#39;</span>,\n  store: <span class="fn">redisStore</span>({"{"}\n    url: <span class="str">&#39;redis://redis-cluster:6379&#39;</span>,\n    prefix: <span class="str">&#39;api:ratelimit:&#39;</span>\n  {"}"})\n{"}"})'
  />

  <h2 id="redis-cluster">Redis Cluster Configuration</h2>

  <div class="code-block">
    <pre><code><span class="kw">import</span> Redis <span class="kw">from</span> <span class="str">'ioredis'</span>

<span class="kw">const</span> cluster = <span class="kw">new</span> Redis.<span class="fn">Cluster</span>([
  {"{"} host: <span class="str">'node1'</span>, port: <span class="num">6379</span> {"}"},
  {"{"} host: <span class="str">'node2'</span>, port: <span class="num">6379</span> {"}"},
  {"{"} host: <span class="str">'node3'</span>, port: <span class="num">6379</span> {"}"}
])

<span class="fn">redisStore</span>({"{"} client: cluster {"}"})</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2 id="multi-tier">Multi-Tier Rate Limiting</h2>

  <p>Apply different limits to different routes:</p>

  <div class="code-block">
    <pre><code><span class="cm">// Global: 1000 requests per minute</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> globalLimiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}
  limit: <span class="num">1000</span>,
  window: <span class="str">'1m'</span>,
  store
{"}"})

<span class="cm">// Strict: 10 requests per minute for auth</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> authLimiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}
  limit: <span class="num">10</span>,
  window: <span class="str">'1m'</span>,
  store,
  key: (req) => <span class="str">`auth:</span>${"{"}req.ip{"}"}<span class="str">`</span>
{"}"})

<span class="cm">// Relaxed: 5000 requests per minute for reads</span>
<span class="kw">const</span> readLimiter = <span class="fn">hitlimit</span>({"{"}
  limit: <span class="num">5000</span>,
  window: <span class="str">'1m'</span>,
  store,
  key: (req) => <span class="str">`read:</span>${"{"}req.ip{"}"}<span class="str">`</span>
{"}"})</code></pre>
  </div>

  <h2 id="performance">Performance by Store</h2>

  <div data-runtime-content="node">
    <table class="options-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Store</th><th>Ops/sec</th><th>Multi-Instance</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>memoryStore</td><td>2,900,000+</td><td>No</td></tr>
        <tr><td>sqliteStore</td><td>376,000+</td><td>No</td></tr>
        <tr><td>redisStore</td><td>6,500+</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
        <tr><td>postgresStore</td><td>3,500+</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div data-runtime-content="bun">
    <table class="options-table">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Store</th><th>Ops/sec</th><th>Latency</th><th>Multi-Instance</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>memoryStore</td><td class="highlight">2,900,000+</td><td>~345ns</td><td>No</td></tr>
        <tr><td>sqliteStore</td><td>331,000+</td><td>~3.0&micro;s</td><td>No</td></tr>
        <tr><td>redisStore</td><td>6,700+</td><td>~148&micro;s</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
        <tr><td>postgresStore</td><td>3,700+</td><td>~273&micro;s</td><td>Yes</td></tr>
